<article class="env-lemma" id="05ZD">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05ZD">Lemma <span data-tag="05ZD">76.7.13</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $f : X \to B$ and $g : Y \to B$ be morphisms of algebraic spaces over $S$ with the same target. Let $p : X \times _ B Y \to X$ and $q : X \times _ B Y \to Y$ be the projection morphisms. The maps from Lemma <a href="/tag/04CX" data-tag="04CX">76.7.6</a> </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  p^*\Omega _{X/B} \oplus q^*\Omega _{Y/B} \longrightarrow \Omega _{X \times _ B Y/B}  \]
</div>
  <p> give an isomorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from the schemes version, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01V1" data-tag="01V1">29.33.11</a> and étale localization, see Lemma <a href="/tag/04CU" data-tag="04CU">76.7.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>